{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2022-04-29 13:34:00', 'title': "ZIONS BANCORPORATION'S BOARD APPROVES SHARE REPURCHASE AND DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK", 'text': "SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZIONS BANCORPORATION, N.A. (NASDAQ: ZION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) AUTHORIZED A SHARE REPURCHASE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022 OF UP TO $50 MILLION. THE BOARD ALSO DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.38 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE MAY 26, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 19, 2022. ADDITIONALLY, THE BOARD DECLARED REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON THE COMPANY'S VARIOUS PERPETUAL PREFERRED SHARES,"}